# Unscrupulous Contractor: "When this creature enters, you may sacrifice a creature. When you do, target player draws two cards
# and loses 2 life." Bot1 sacrifices its Memnite ("a creature" is one: two are refused, CR 701.21) and the reflexive trigger
# (CR 603.12) goes on the stack with Bot2 as its target: Bot2 draws exactly two (seven to nine) and loses exactly 2 (20 to 18).
# Bot1 itself is untouched (hand and life), and the Contractor stays on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Unscrupulous Contractor
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
